# --- Raw source data ---
# Data/raw IS tracked: the extracts are synthetic and small, and committing them is
# what makes the SQL build reproducible from a clone. See .gitattributes - they are
# stored byte-for-byte because BULK INSERT reads them with ROWTERMINATOR = 0x0d0a.
Data/Scaled/

# --- Credentials: never commit ---
.env
*.env
config.local.*
**/credentials.json

# --- Power BI per-machine state ---
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/cache.abf
**/.pbi/editorSettings.json
*.pbix

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
